#: kcmaccess.cpp:246
msgid "Audible Bell"
msgstr "Słyšomny zwónčk"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:253
msgid "Use &system bell"
msgstr "Wužiwaj &systemowy zwónčk"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:255
msgid "Us&e customized bell"
msgstr "Wužiwaj &postajeny zwónčk"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:257
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, the default system bell will be used. See the "
"\"System Bell\" control module for how to customize the system bell. Normally, "
"this is just a \"beep\"."
msgstr ""
"Hdyž je tuta opcija wubrana, wužiwa so standardny systemowy zwónčk. Pohladajće "
"do kontrolneho modula \"Systemowy zwónčk\", zo byšće zhonił, kak so systemowy "
"zwónčk konfiguruje. Zwjetša je to proste piwčenje."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:260
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to use a customized bell, playing a sound file. "
"If you do this, you will probably want to turn off the system bell."
"<p> Please note that on slow machines this may cause a \"lag\" between the "
"event causing the bell and the sound being played."
msgstr ""
"Wubjerće tutu opciju, chceće-li jako zwónčk zwukowu dataju wothrać. Jeli to "
"činiće, dyrbiće najskerje systemowy zwónčk hasnyć."
"<p> Prošu wopomńće, zo móhło to na pomałym computeru přestawka nastać mjez "
"podawkom, kiž je zwónčk wuwołał, a wothrawanjom zwuka."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:267
msgid "Sound &to play:"
msgstr "Zwuk, kiž ma so &hrać:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:272
msgid ""
"If the option \"Use customized bell\" is enabled, you can choose a sound file "
"here. Click \"Browse...\" to choose a sound file using the file dialog."
msgstr ""
"Hdyž je opcija \"Konfigurowany zwónčk wužiwać\" zaswěćena, móžeće tu zwukowu "
"dataju wubrać. Klikńće na \"Přelistować...\", zo byšće z datajowym dialogom "
"zwukowu dataju wubrali."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:289
msgid "Visible Bell"
msgstr "Widźomny zwónčk"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:295
msgid "&Use visible bell"
msgstr "&Wužiwaj wizuelny zwónčk"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:297
msgid ""
"This option will turn on the \"visible bell\", i.e. a visible notification "
"shown every time that normally just a bell would occur. This is especially "
"useful for deaf people."
msgstr ""
"Tuta opcija zaswěći \"wizuelny zwónčk\", t.r. zo so wužiwar optisce na něšto "
"skedźbnja, na čož by so hewak ze zwónčkom skedźbnił. To je hłuchim wosebje "
"wužitne."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:303
msgid "I&nvert screen"
msgstr "Wobrazowku &inwertować"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:306
msgid ""
"All screen colors will be inverted for the amount of time specified below."
msgstr "Wšě barby na wobrazowce so na deleka specifikowany čas inwertuja."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:308
msgid "F&lash screen"
msgstr "Wobrazowka &zabłysknje"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:310
msgid ""
"The screen will turn to a custom color for the amount of time specified below."
msgstr "Wobrazowka na deleka specifikowany čas konfigurowanu barbu přiwozmje. "

#: kcmaccess.cpp:316
msgid ""
"Click here to choose the color used for the \"flash screen\" visible bell."
msgstr ""
"Klikńće tu, zo byšće barbu za wizuelny zwónčk \"Wobrazowka zabłysknje\" "
"wubrali."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:323
msgid "Duration:"
msgstr "Kak dołho:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:324 kcmaccess.cpp:413 kcmaccess.cpp:445
msgid " msec"
msgstr "msek"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:326
msgid ""
"Here you can customize the duration of the \"visible bell\" effect being shown."
msgstr "Tu móžeće nastajić, kak dołho ma efekt \"wizuelneho zwónčka\" trać."

